From a49e62de3243a040c6e1c7dad529e6d96333a200 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: warelik <warelik@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 04:47:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 8/9] Retain rootless remote workspaces and their project
 groups

Keep remote workspaces without open roots visible, restorable and
labelled with distinct hosts and history. Distinguish rootless SSH, WSL
and Docker connections, sanitize persisted group hosts, restore stable
connection identities, protect overlapping context starts and check
project metadata only for nonempty group keys.

